      "content": "I strongly advise against waiting until next week, as only a healthcare professional can definitively rule out a stroke. While some strokes present subtly, ignoring facial changes is a risk you cannot afford. If you are uncomfortable with the ER, try an urgent care clinic for an immediate assessment. For any sudden, unexplained facial asymmetry, it is always better to be checked out than to risk a delay.",
